2026-09-10T07:00:21.0820200Z [36;1m    cargo test $target_filter -p "$package"[0m
2026-09-10T07:00:21.0820522Z [36;1m    echo "::endgroup::"[0m
2026-09-10T07:00:21.0820904Z [36;1m  done[0m
